    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240906212939\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Eurydice Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1037\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Eurydice Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240906212939\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>正义十字军</b>\n</p><p>一位身穿纯白的处刑者，坚信自己的行为。作为铲除不义之人，她释放火焰，无情地摧毁邪恶。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eurydice_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:74px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Eurydice_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Eurydice S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (278 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:74px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/36/Eurydice_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=2